    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e6155497288621b5ce9f4d0f4affc1eb37d47c684a73726a7fda60764b93173b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ちゃ……ちゃんと聞いてますよ！？\nその刀は、えっと……。\n握れば酔っぱらう『泥棒太刀』でしたっけ？",
      "jp_sha256": "46bcf402285b21afc00cb16ad94a1999b33c729343b3ed32d768649e5738166f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "제…… 제대로 듣고 있어요!?\n그 칼은, 그러니까…….\n쥐면 취해 버리는 ‘도둑칼’이었죠?",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "2acc09309be9bff55c96cf1e0bbf0af1ac11a2af905e1eefdf6ee1c63975489c:000002_2200542523014135088:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ちゃ……ちゃんと聞いてますよ！？\nその刀は、えっと……。\n握れば酔っぱらう『泥棒太刀』でしたっけ？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2640345df7cfacbebc375fcd6c4fd53897178f98bb6a6d3f591456490f8ede25",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ぶっぶー、不正解！！　正解は『泥酔太刀』だよ。\n『泥棒太刀』ってなに？　美少年は酔っ払ったら\n泥棒するぐらい手癖悪いの？　うぇっ、鬼ヤバ！！",
      "jp_sha256": "d1e1cf1a336c8c3a37eb7ba4c62f725c84bc9f7b4c6e86fb44c06af75f0d91cb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "땡, 오답!! 정답은 ‘만취도’야.\n‘도둑칼’은 뭐야? 미소년은 취하면\n도둑질할 만큼 손버릇이 나빠져? 우웩, 완전 오니 대박!!",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
